        <body>
            <div xml:id="d731">

                <pb facs="1167" n="1071" xml:id="pg1071"/>

                <head>No. 729.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Fish
                        to Mr. Hall.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-11-12"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 12,
                        1873</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>You will demand of authorities the most ample rights secured by treaty or law of
                    nations for all American citizens on the Virginius. Instruct consul at Santiago
                    to see that they have counsel and advocates, and that he report as to all
                    judicial or other proceedings.</p>
                <closer><signed>FISH.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
